  "findings": [
    "Primary indicator height is 3dp, minimum length 24dp, label-relative inset 2dp on each side; the diagram/table identifies top rounded corners with a flat bottom.",
    "Primary indicator and active text/icon use the primary color role. The label/indicator move together semantically, while focus and selection remain distinct behavior concerns.",
    "Secondary tabs use a full-width 2dp line. House inset tabs are Peter's separate treatment, not Material secondary tabs.",
    "Material containers are 48dp text-only and 64dp stacked icon plus label; these do not silently replace house spacing/density.",
    "The accessibility guidance distinguishes focus navigation and activation and warns against continuously looping a scroll surface. House automatic/manual activation follows the approved APG-style contract.",
    "Badge content, panels, app-bar placement and swipe interactions remain separate composition responsibilities. No automatic swipe gesture is added by this review."
  ],
