  "behaviorReference": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/tabs/",
  "implementationFindings": [
    "Material Web uses ElementInternals roles on the tab/list hosts and presentation divs; it is not a native-button implementation.",
    "Its autoActivate defaults false and its slot-change handler chooses a replacement when active is missing. House automatic default and one-time initial selection remain the approved contract.",
    "Its per-tab indicator uses a timed 250ms animation. House motion stays in the shared spring indicator.",
    "Material Web documents external panels with aria-controls and aria-labelledby; house registration must establish these relationships across its chosen shadow boundaries."
  ],
