    "finding": "A panel default label reference directly into its sibling Tab shadow root is retained by Chromium/Firefox but filtered by WebKit. Referencing the public Tab host passes all three engines; Chromium also computes the icon-only native button name through that host and exposes controls/label relationships.",
    "limits": "These bare-element checks are a mechanism prerequisite. Actual family integration and actual speech output remain to verify."
  }
